  "aprVersion": "1.0-beta.6",
  "metadata": {
    "title": "T"
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "s",
      "title": "S",
      "prompts": [
        {
          "id": "echo",
          "label": "Echo",
          "hints": {
            "exprValue": "_id"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

**Example 11.4-5.** `_today` comes from the caller.

```apr-example
